        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>NGP 101V-48, 48\" Rain Guard Vinyl  Blade Sweep</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis 4 foot rain guard door sweep has a 3/4\" projection off the door to channel water away for the door. Vinyl blade sweep help seal the doors bottom specially if there is a gap. Made from Aluminum alloy 6063 and has slotted screw holes for easy adjustments. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/36-inch-rain-guard-vinyl-blade-sweep-ngp-101v-36\"><b>36\" Rain Drip Guard Door Sweep</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nField sizable for doors 37\" to 48\" wide. Packaged with installation screws.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for NGP 101V-48 Door Sweep\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Vinyl Blade Height: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection Off Door: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Length: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Vinyl Color: Gray</li>\r\n<li>Screws: #6 x 3/4\" Stainless Steel SMS</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/101V-cutsheet.pdf?v=1704262389\" target=\"new\"><b>NGP 101V Cutsheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
